<!------------------------------------- Launch Command -------------------------------------->
## Input cmd (press 2 to laydown and press 2 to standup and press 4 to run)
  ```bash
  ros2 run keyboard_input keyboard_input 
  ```

## Launch DRL Student
  ```bash
   ros2 launch edge_drl_student drl_student.launch.py
  ```

## Bringup (other components + Gazebo + Navigation)
  ```bash
  ros2 launch edge_bringup bringup.gazebo.launch.py
  ```

## Navigation
  ```bash
  ros2 launch edge_nav_bringup system_simulation_with_route_planner.launch.py
  ```

<!------------------------------------- Extra Command -------------------------------------->
## Manual Reset
  ```bash
  ros2 service call /edge/manual_reset std_srvs/srv/Trigger
  ```

## Reboot the host machine
  ```bash
  sudo reboot
  ```

## Launch the Tensorboard
  ```bash
  tensorboard --logdir $HOME/edge_ws/src/edge-brain-go2 
  ```


## Compilation
  ```bash
  cd $HOME/edge_ws/src/edge-brain-go2 && ./edge_scripts/build_ws.sh
  ```

## Trigger Switching Statistics

  ### 1). Inquery: 
  ```bash
  ros2 service call /edge/get_switching_stats edge_msgs/srv/GetSwitchingStats 
  ```

  ### ii). Clear: 
  ```bash
  ros2 service call /edge/reset_switching_stats edge_msgs/srv/ResetSwitchingStats
  ```

## Safety Patch Tuning

  ### 1). Run LMI Test
  ```bash
  cd $HOME/edge_ws/src/edge-brain-go2/edge_locomotion/edge_phy_teacher/src/optimization/third_party/cvxpygen && python ddp_lmi_solver.py
  ```

  ### 2). Generate C code and deploy solver:
  ```bash
    cd $HOME/edge_ws/src/edge-brain-go2/edge_locomotion/edge_phy_teacher/src/optimization/third_party/cvxpygen && python build_solver.py
  ```

  ### 3). Print Synthesized Gain:
  ```bash
  ros2 run edge_phy_teacher control_gain_listener
  ```

